msgid "Note: to win the game all terminals <strong>and all <em>cables</em></strong> need to be connected to the server!"
msgstr "Henwies: Dormit Een dat Speel winnen kann, mööt all Konsolen <strong>un all <em>Kavels</em></strong> na den Server tokoppelt wesen."

